  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5601.16 “Research activities” as used in RSA 260:14, V(a)(4), means analysis of only statistical or non-personal information contained in motor vehicle records by a leg",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5601.16 “Research activities” as used in RSA 260:14, V(a)(4), means analysis of only statistical or non-personal information contained in motor vehicle records by a legitimate business for purposes related to motor vehicles or drivers.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, eff 1-1-02",
